002&utm_content=3D9612>=0A, because foreign holdings of Treasuries remain b=
arely below their peak. The =0Aterm premium - a measure of the extra compen=
sation that investors demand over =0Aand above interest rate risk - has bar=
ely budged.=0A=0AWhat has happened instead is a big shift in expectations a=
bout monetary =0Apolicy, driven largely by US officials=E2=80=99 communicat=
