rongly hawkish speech at Jackson Hole in late =0AAugust, widely seen as an =
attempt to compensate for his earlier press =0Aconference. That cemented a =
hike last month.=0A=0ABut why did Fed funds futures (as gauged by the Bloom=
berg World Interest Rate =0AProbabilities function) price in another full p=
ercentage point of hikes from =0Athere=3F Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent=
=E2=80=99s interventions in the bond market =0Amight have had something to =
do with it. After promising to step up the =0ATreasury=E2=80=99s bond purch=
ases in August in an attempt to cap yields, he went on to =0Asay that there=
