an financial system that led to =0Athe Tequila Crisis, so this Treasury sca=
re has shone a light on where the =0Aworld=E2=80=99s greatest vulnerabiliti=
es are to be found. That doesn=E2=80=99t mean that France =0Amust inevitabl=
y undergo anything as bad as the disaster that engulfed Mexico, =0Abut risk=
s are elevated.=0A=0AWhat now in France=3F=0A=0AIn the latest development, =
the government published the proposed budget for =0A2027. The main economic=
